                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is...  Really something...\n\nI can only say one good thing: the artwork is nice...  When it doesn't look like the guy is yelling at his thumb.\n\nEverything else...  Ugh...  Especially the English...  If you get turned on by this sexy line: \"gouging out your insides\" during sex...  Well then...  I have a book for you!!!\n\n[i]MC:[/i]  SIGH.  These Otome games and their USELESS freaking MCs...  My goodness...!  Okay...  She does do chores...  There is one thing.  Apart from that: She can't speak correctly, she is utterly naive, she misunderstands and mistrusts overly too much, she runs into battles WHEN TOLD NOT TO and YELLS at the guy TO STOP doing WHAT HE IS SUPPOSED TO!!!\n\nShe also tries to throw her life away for [i]clothes[/i] (NOT A JOKE!!!) and at one point for a kid, whose MOTHER... DIDN'T EVEN BOTHER...  TO GO INTO THE HOUSE TO SAVE HER!!!!!!!!  WHAT KIND OF PARENT IS THAT?!  Are you all for REAL?!  You REALLY think...  A GOOD PARENT...  Would ASK...  A COMPLETE IMBECILE OF A GIRL...  TO GO INTO A BURNING BUILDING...  TO RESCUE THEIR OWN OFFSPRING?!\n\nI hate this...  I hate the psychology of this book...  It's f-ed up worse than reality at this point!\n\nAnd it pains me to say this...  BUT!  If this VN was actually DARK/Psychological?  Maybe...  JUST MAYBE some of these things would work out.  Otherwise?  STOP TEACHING PEOPLE TO RUN INTO BURNING BUILDINGS OR BATTLES FOR THE MOST INSIPID REASONS!!!!!\n\n[i]The Shinsengumi:[/i]  As a group -> Developers portray them as completely inept, ridiculous, lacking tact and they are all first and foremost \"for their own pleasure\".  Excuse me?  Weren't the Shinsengumi made up of mostly Samurais?  Does the \"Code of Honour\"...  MEAN NOTHING TO YOU?!\n\n\"For their own pleasure...\"  NO.\n\n[i]The Guys:[/i]  (BTW, none of these men know the meaning of the word \"NO\" and the MC just goes along with their r*pey inclinations.  Enjoy?)\n\nI seriously have to lower my standards to barely ANYTHING to write at least something on these creeps.  So...:\n\n-> Shinpachi and Hajime...  Aren't that bad.  They have a rather STUPID \"drama moment\"...  But apart from that...  Those Routes are the least bit...  R*pe like.\n\n-> Okita is a groper.  His Route is bland and it sucks.  There is no point to it.  If you read it, you'll just waste time.  You're welcome.\n\n-> Harada...  Hmm...  His Route is just full of ridiculous misunderstandings...  Because they are both stupid.  He isn't bad per say...  But he is far more gropey that Okita.  Whatever.\n\n-> Heisuke ->  This is the [b]Worst ROUTE in EXISTENCE[/b] (probably...).  He is TERRIBLE.  He gets off coming close on dying and he is utterly hedonistic to a point where he tries to r*pe her in the middle of fire and hopes to \"finish\" before they both die.\n\nThat's normal...  Right?  Apart from that, he would even let a child die.  That's how much he doesn't give a damn.\n\nHe is utter scum.  Below that even.\n\nIf THIS were the TRUE Shinsengumi?  Not only he would be severely beaten and disciplined...  He wouldn't even freaking BE A CAPTAIN!!!!!!!!\n\nHe is a piece of utter crap and this character should NEVER exist...  ESPECIALLY when YOUNG ADULTS ARE READING THIS!!!!!!\n\nTHIS.  ISN'T.  NORMAL!!!!!!!!!\n\nThat's it.  I am literally tired of this BS.\n\nNot worth it.\n\nUnless you want to giggle at all the ridiculous sheet and mistakes.  Jeez!",
